@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox
title Recording a payment across two lessons

participant ":PaymentCommands" as Commands
participant ":TutorLedgerData" as Data

[-> Commands : execute("pay S1 90 L1 L2")
activate Commands
Commands -> Data : getStudent("S1")
activate Data
Data --> Commands : student
deactivate Data
Commands -> Commands : parsePaymentAmount("90")
activate Commands
Commands --> Commands : 90.00
deactivate Commands
Commands -> Commands : validateLessonsForPayment(...)
activate Commands
note right of Commands
  Each lesson must belong to S1, be listed once,
  and be neither cancelled nor already paid.
  The amount must not exceed what they owe.
end note
Commands --> Commands
deactivate Commands

loop for each lesson, in the order typed, while money remains
  Commands -> Data : updateLessonAmountPaid(id, paid + allocation)
  activate Data
  Data --> Commands : updated lesson
  deactivate Data
end
Commands -->[ : "Recorded payment of $90.00 for 2 lessons: L1, L2."
deactivate Commands
note over Commands, Data
  Every check runs before the first update,
  so a rejected payment changes nothing.
end note
@enduml
